{"license":"CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Institutions for Collective Action: Kroniek van een Bazenbondje, interview met Peter van de Pijl"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:112574"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E. J. de Jager"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Reis van de Razzia"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"E. J. de Jager MA"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Erik J. de Jager Documentary Films & Projects"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Peter van de Pijl heeft een glasbedrijf met personeel en is sinds 1981 lid van het Bazenbondje.<br>Secretaris Cees ten Have brengt een aantal uitnodigingen voor de vergadering met de hand rond en treft Peter in Café IJzicht waar hij wordt geïnterviewd. Peter haalt herinneringen op aan secretaris Jan Waal en zijn onnavolgbare stijl van notuleren. Peter mist die tijden, toen alle nog wat gezelliger leek te zijn. Hij vertelt tegen Cees waaron hij niet meer zo frequent op de vergaderingen komt: veel werk en wat tegenslag in de zaak waren de aanleiding om zich wat terug te trekken. Peter is aanvankelijk tegen een Broodfonds-achtige benadering binnen het Bazenbondje, maar ziet er na enig praten toch ook we de zinnigheid van in.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"geschiedenis"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"cultureel erfgoed"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"coöperatieve verenigingen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"commons"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"broodfonds"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"arbeidsongeschiktheidsverzekering"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"zelfstandig ondernemen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"zzp-er"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"producer","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"producerName":{"typeName":"producerName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Erik J. de Jager"},"producerAffiliation":{"typeName":"producerAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Reis van de Razzia"},"producerURL":{"typeName":"producerURL","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/stichtingreisvanderazzia.nl"}}]},{"typeName":"productionD